title: "Checkrail: Deterministic Quality Gates & Hierarchical Context Scaffolding for AI Coding Agents"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: "Checkrail is an open-source deterministic harness providing nine verification tiers (Gates 0-8), layered context hierarchies (L0/L1/L2), scratch-repo smoke tests, and session continuity protocols designed to structure and safeguard autonomous AI agent code modifications."
date-released: 2026-10-04
url: "https://github.com/seyed-milad-jalilian/checkrail"
